        "description": "Stops of Graubünden with their municipality, operator, modes, system codes and names in five languages. XREF finds a stop by UIC number, abbreviation, name, a Wikidata item or another system's code, or by a translated name.\n\nConsumer API `stops`, contract version 1, declared by the model release Public transport stops of Graubünden 1.8.1. A read takes the live data of a workspace (`workspace`, default: the deployment's default workspace) or one of its publications (`publication`: an ID or `latest`). Every `GET` answers an `ETag` and `304 Not Modified` to a matching `If-None-Match`."
      },
